hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2689","Ahmad ibn Mani' narrated to us; Ibn Abi Zaydah narrated to us; from Ibn Jurayj; from Abu al-Zubayr; from Jabir (RA), who said: ""We would put on garments when entering ihram, and we would wear [other] garments during the state of ihram that we had not entered ihram in, and we wore the mushaqqaq, which is indeed merely dyed with clay."""
